@SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check
GET {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Languages
GET {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/languages
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a Language
POST {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/languages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "French",
  "code": "fr"
}

###

### Update a Language
PUT {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/languages/{{languageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Français",
  "code": "fr"
}

###

### Get All Greetings
GET {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/greetings
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Greeting by Language Code
GET {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/greetings/by-language/en
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Formal Greeting by Language Code
GET {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/greetings/by-language/en?formal=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a Greeting
POST {{SymphonyTest1.Api_HostAddress}}/api/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languageId": "{{languageId}}",
  "greetingText": "Bonjour",
  "formal": false
}

###
